+# Copyright (c) 2026, HUAWEI CORPORATION. All rights reserved.
+#
+# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
+"""DSv4 hyper connections (mHC) under MindSpeed's MoE forward/backward overlap.
+
+MindSpeed's staged layer forward supports hyper connections through a two-stage
+protocol it expects the layer to provide::
+
+    hidden, post, comb = layer.attn_mhc(hidden, mhc_stage='pre')
+    hidden             = layer.attn_mhc(hidden, mhc_stage='post',
+                                        residual=..., post=post, comb=comb)
+
+and the same for ``mlp_mhc``.  It detaches ``post`` / ``comb`` so the pre stage's
+graph can be run separately, and its backward already joins the three gradients
